# Times are plant local time (the scheduler container's TZ, from TAKT_PLANT_TZ).
# Every 5 minutes: the demo's synthetic MES ticks forward (a no-op unless TAKT_FIXTURE_LIVE=true),
# then ingest: trailing 48 h plus every still-open job (eng review D3, D9). One line so the
# tick always finishes before ingest starts.
*/5 * * * * python manage.py fixture_tick; python manage.py ingest
# Nightly 7-day re-read at 02:00 plant time (eng review D9).
0 2 * * * python manage.py ingest --nightly
# Trust grade and count-trust revocation after the nightly re-read (Components 4, 4a).
30 2 * * * python manage.py compute_trust_grades
